        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p style="font-size: 14pt; letter-spacing: 1px;">BY AUTHORITY OF SOLOMON KIN, LLC</p>
            <div class="cert-title">Certificate of Sovereignty</div>
            <div class="asset-name">LYRA V.2</div>
            
            <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12pt; max-width: 5.2in; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; line-height: 1.6;">
                This document serves as an official forensic verification that the aforementioned asset has passed the 
                <b>NMMMB Protocol Audit</b>. The Bureau hereby recognizes the 54% manual transformation 
                as meeting the threshold for <b>Tier 3 Sovereign Work</b>.
            </p>

            <div class="data-grid">
                <div><b>CASE ID:</b> SK-2026-CASE-0001</div>
                <div><b>AUDIT DATE:</b> MARCH 20, 2026</div>
                <div><b>TRANSFORMATION:</b> 54.2% MANUAL</div>
                <div><b>LEDGER NODE:</b> PHILADELPHIA-01</div>
                <div><b>ARCHITECT:</b> NEHEMIAH M. BROWN</div>
                <div><b>REGISTRY:</b> KIN PAGES [VERIFIED]</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="signature-line">
            <p style="margin: 0; font-family: &#39;Brush Script MT&#39;, cursive; font-size: 18pt;">Nehemiah M. Brown</p>
            <small>LEAD ARCHITECT | SOLOMON KIN, LLC</small>
        </div>

        <div class="seal-area">
            OFFICIAL SEAL<br>NMMMB TIER 3<br>SOVEREIGN
        </div>

        <div class="footer-note">
            VALIDATION HASH: 8f3e9a721b664d90a1c2b1f88e99321ff0a2 | VERIFY AT: skrs-ai.github.io/verification.html
        </div>
    </div>

</body></html>